1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,800
Why are you trying to hurt innocents ?

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,110
It looks like the Heng Yue Sect also has talented people.

26
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,560
I'll tell you

27
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,920
if you can beat me !

28
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,510
It’s Senior Brother’s Eagle Claw !

29
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,600
He'll win for sure !

30
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:14,910
Die !

31
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:26,200
A mere 6th layer of Qi Condensation dares to try to hurt me !?

32
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,870
You just wait until I chop off your limbs

33
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,600
and make you regret being born in this trash Heng Yue Sect !

34
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,080
Brat...

35
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:54,080
You brought this upon yourself !

36
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,000
Go !

37
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,280
Explode !

38
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,910
Who is this Senior Brother ?

39
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:52,830
I have no idea...

40
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,190
It looks like he's a regular disciple.

41
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,680
He...

42
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:57,960
he is Wang Lin !

43
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,280
He's that trash who only got accepted because

44
00:03:58,080 --> 00:04:00,880
Xu Fei
Heng Yue Sect disciple
3rd layer of Qi Condensation

45
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,720
he tried to kill himself.

46
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,000
Weird...

47
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:07,150
Why does it look like no one knows that disciple ?

48
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,510
You’re only at the 6th layer of Qi Condensation !

49
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:12,030
It should be impossible for you to kill my Black Python !

50
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:24,230
14th layer of Qi Condensation ?

51
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,160
How can this be ?

52
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,510
I surrender ! I surrender !

53
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:36,930
Stop...

54
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,430
Stop !

55
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,080
When you were about to hurt innocents earlier,

56
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,550
would you have stopped ?!

57
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,950
You’re courting death !

58
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,360
You dare to try to kill in Heng Yue ?

59
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:01,510
Do you think the Heng Yue Sect is that weak ?

60
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:02,000
Liu Wenju
Heng Yue Sect Ancestor
Middle stage Core Formation

61
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,270
Greetings Ancestor.

62
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,960
Is your name Wang Lin ?

63
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,790
From now on,

64
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,670
you are a core sect disciple.

65
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,600
Thank you Ancestor !

66
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,270
This competition was won by

67
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,950
the Heng Yue Sect !

68
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,310
Amazing ! Junior Brother, you’re incredible !

69
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:26,360
How did you cultivate to peak Qi Condensation ?

70
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,110
Yeah, how did you do it ?

71
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,390
This fellow cultivator really is good natured.

72
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,870
Little sister, let’s go.

73
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,590
The Xuan Dao Sect won't let this slide,

74
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,950
the Heng Yue Sect is in trouble.

75
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,200
We won’t see you off.

76
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,270
We’ll meet again.

77
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:06,190
The Sect Competition has concluded.

78
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:10,590
The mortals attending will be escorted out by disciples.

79
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,040
Father !

80
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,320
Mother !

81
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,320
I didn't fail to live up to your expectations !

82
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:24,000
The Ancestor said he’ll take me as a white-robed disciple !

83
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,400
In the future, your son will...

84
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,440
Mother...

85
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,760
What’s wrong ?

86
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,640
My son...

87
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,880
You’ve lost weight....

88
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,310
Mother...

89
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:41,870
Dear,

90
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,510
didn’t we bring something for Tie Zhu ?

91
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,550
I almost forgot...

92
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,760
Take this, and this,

93
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:51,200
and this spiced beef, take all of it !

94
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,350
Okay.

95
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,390
Mother...

96
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,920
You must also take care of yourself.

97
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,280
This bead contains my Divine Sense.

98
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,000
If you’re ever in danger,

99
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,110
you just need to crush it

100
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,760
and I’ll come immediately.

101
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,750
Okay, okay, your father will remember.

102
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,640
Let's go.

103
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,400
Juniors of the Heng Yue Sect,

104
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,190
leave Heng Yue Mountain right now !

105
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,590
Juniors of the Heng Yue Sect,

106
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,550
leave Heng Yue Mountain right now !

107
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,680
Senior Piao Nanzi,

108
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:46,560
our sects have always been on good terms.

109
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:48,760
Piao Nanzi
Xuan Dao Sect Ancestor
Middle stage Nascent Soul

110
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,520
My master still hasn't returned...

111
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,040
Hasn’t returned ?

112
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:55,110
I thought Junior Ouyang told you a few days ago.

113
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,870
Your master...

114
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:01,950
and all the Nascent Soul Ancestors of the Heng Yue Sect

115
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:06,150
died on the Foreign Battlefield.

116
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,430
Master...

117
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:11,550
And now, this old man has come to claim Heng Yue Mountain !

118
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,510
Everyone, stand your ground !

119
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,080
The Heng Yue Sect has been around for a thousand years.

120
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,200
It won't fall by your hands !

121
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,790
All of the Elders

122
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,480
will help me to activate the Sect Protection Formation !

123
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,600
Huanglong,

124
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,990
take the disciples down the mountain.

125
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,790
All the disciples, follow me !

126
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,710
Hurry up !

127
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,320
Sect Protection Formation,

128
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,190
activate !

129
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,350
All of the Heng Yue Sect disciples

130
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,430
must leave the mountain !

131
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,320
It's just a mere Nascent Soul cultivator...

132
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,750
He's just an ant I would've crushed in the past.

133
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,710
Disciple,

134
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,640
come with me.

135
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,280
Master...

136
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,680
If you gently open the formation,

137
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,880
everything will go well.

138
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,320
Wait for me to pack my things,

139
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,960
and we’ll leave together.

140
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,200
Leave ?

141
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,760
The Elders and Ancestors are operating the formation.

142
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,800
Why isn't Master going ?

143
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,760
They can't protect the sect.

144
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,950
Before a Nascent Soul cultivator, it's useless.

145
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,950
This Foundation Stabilizing Tea

146
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,600
will lose its effect if we don't drink it now.

147
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,000
We can't take it with us

148
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,760
so we might as well drink it.

149
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,670
Even I don't often drink this herb.

150
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,040
My disciple,

151
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,560
have some.

152
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,880
There's a lot of it,

153
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,520
why aren't you also drinking ?

154
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,030
Why aren't you listening to your Master ?

155
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,830
This is a rare tea,

156
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,720
drink it now !

157
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,920
But if I drink it,

158
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,960
it will silently poison me again, right ?

159
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,000
Just like that pill...

160
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,480
What did you put inside ?

161
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,520
Qi Scattering Grass

162
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:15,070
or Three Threadworm Grass ?

163
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,430
Since you already know,

164
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,960
don’t blame me for being ruthless !

165
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,360
A binding formation !?

166
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,390
You insisted on doing this the hard way !

167
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,760
If this formation was operated by a Nascent Soul,

168
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,910
it would be truly formidable.
